cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use LANTERN in research, please cite it as below."
title: "LANTERN: Local AI for Navigation, Triage and Emergency Reporting with No network"
abstract: >-
  An offline edge-AI kit for flood search and rescue that runs on an NVIDIA Jetson Orin Nano:
  rover-based mapping and search, on-device person detection, offline situation reporting with a
  small fine-tuned language model, a policy guardian with human approval, and store-and-forward sync.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Moore
    given-names: Matthew
repository-code: "https://github.com/MattyIceMatrix/lantern"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.0.1
date-released: "2026-11-13"
keywords:
  - edge AI
  - search and rescue
  - flood
  - robotics
  - offline
